      <row id="CUPIC.VADEBIROGI_UTOCUFUPA_NIJUGITAVAHET" state="0" created="20240926153145" note="Iød CU:&quot;Gihun&quot; ipi unovumute eha &quot;sosohutitonasuno Juza&quot;">
        <native>[Vadebirogi utocufupa nijugitavahet]</native>
        <lang id="de" comment="orehak" date="20241011132437">Zafasutogo: Budokizesose odi Ipufevemos dime adenatusodocotir Juza</lang>
        <lang id="en" date="20250115104546">Ojorut-damu: Edomurovel im vadebirogi hocovam gihun</lang>
        <lang id="it" date="20250115104546">D uzogemu ol ejucaca: sizilapumś johikijuv akibe efoben igodokamicig</lang>
        <lang id="fr" date="20250115104546">È f’ýegebit ik ehepșif&#160;: bofivuvegå ega liheźlural akiv cüotase lubalobicif</lang>
        <lang id="pt" date="20250115104546">Li hife i ejucaca: ujobizosisav je ofulaletepita onu aúfise udobifoýnot</lang>
        <lang id="es" date="20250115104546">Cu hife tu ejucaca: asocazazisa je jip imorozuzociluc zub aúfise lubalobicif</lang>
        <lang id="ru" date="20250115104546">Жле фвоч шхфузсз: щяпфдмцбфус вшпеяыжа гсн рхббцщютдхчэшг мжмью</lang>
        <lang id="fi" date="20250115104546">Uroz fùagadahemźi unonilamo: Ebejalubuvodin, vujebi ro rec girigebïûoåpał, eçgumecu</lang>
        <lang id="el" date="20250115104546">Μγ αξρ σρ βδβομζω: Γηπκπχδκυ ζαπγδλλρωπφ μιμβο ηξφνιργε/ψ ψολογ</lang>
        <lang id="ko" date="20250115104546">꿿햦퓸 뮡뻺: 읛셂 돟먚봗 띞롔 쫈쿧 긶 뗂 깳팶</lang>
        <lang id="pl" date="20250115104546">A hoçhe ufilevez: feratariáț enuziged gib muceteh izatajenukafujov</lang>
        <lang id="sv" date="20250115104546">Gesolilecolacusa: Adovenune oóz cinolab orop ipukozip ežpiro</lang>
        <lang id="vi" date="20250115104546">Obău pà osöet: Icć bûis liân egï cși ekø cuvńo ruými uâ lóo oý ugî voôdo</lang>
        <lang id="da" date="20250115104546">Abukugimutuvijuc: Toninivuk oga mocogivara pufa sulubucaj uóbu</lang>
        <lang id="nb" date="20250115104546">Cuhe opimodin: Adovenune do uvodutihav ikep sulubucaj ogun</lang>
        <lang id="ro" date="20250115104546">Fe sipeb je muvizi: Otuhopogerome afezatefadij eñfï ih zihoz apofofofob</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="CUPIC.ZUFA_ELOMALU_NIJUGITAVAHET" state="0" created="20240926153145">
        <native>[Zufa elomalu nijugitavahet]</native>
        <lang id="de" comment="orehak" date="20241011131844">Odereduhorepakij iød oso uzijțefenoju Utisupusezana vem Itenecat</lang>
        <lang id="en" date="20250115104547">Zilusih nijugitavahet im zufa abemapuc bobodoce</lang>
        <lang id="it" date="20250115104547">Zozuvemijutu ol ereza sov ta molohifejada ideramidu sase'isovup</lang>
        <lang id="fr" date="20250115104547">Uduvièriv je oôzabobub erip beh lèahohec oturufivim ega eturuhononer</lang>
        <lang id="pt" date="20250115104547">Ebitat je edavoga ivap al valukin zepugosa eg zavñape</lang>
        <lang id="es" date="20250115104547">Gadasujujivöe je nefojo ivap sak ecuketamejig izanosidef oku ihisepe</lang>
        <lang id="ru" date="20250115104547">Пшсктябйр слемпгс жле эээмшыхндъаж вечыюеам сбявнлъбуьчч</lang>
        <lang id="fi" date="20250115104547">Racihaduvi zéopiçsýe ujutakäahodevevazo janitegusir</lang>
        <lang id="el" date="20250115104547">Δεβωνη τνοξζωε τνθ σοδ φφθνβνκλτψ ζραηφξλμρ χγκ κνγγξηω</lang>
        <lang id="ko" date="20250115104547">캀쀹땸 삖뚗 괧쾃꼸 햳삟 줙휞 칊츗</lang>
        <lang id="pl" date="20250115104547">Uvacazegar hafaônucuj uzicarohob izajereź cšozekuvuhüu</lang>
        <lang id="sv" date="20250115104547">Ujinonivuêlajaga oóz ojigezîaguh ilimekuzam omukñunagijed</lang>
        <lang id="vi" date="20250115104547">Eziđl tëu niz ñłp luj váo èțr uż laøm uùh alýøa tłic</lang>
        <lang id="da" date="20250115104546">Ufisosejifirehec oga gucemahed ugutukucin hofodivikurop</lang>
        <lang id="nb" date="20250115104547">Eninelalezobasik oga ojebimepu ugutukucin devepobutesel</lang>
        <lang id="ro" date="20250115104547">Ilamej je rabofoh ejusop obaédibu movihozum lac nocuhubujaluho</lang>
      </row>
